### Kevalon ERP Module 5: Customer Endpoints HTTP Requests Collection
# This file is compatible with the VS Code REST Client extension.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/customer
@accessToken = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = YOUR_COMPANY_ID
@customerId = YOUR_CUSTOMER_ID

### 1. Create a New Customer (Success)
# Creates a customer. Enforces validation of email format and optional GSTIN format.
# Automatically creates a linked COA account under "Sundry Debtors" (code 1230).
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "name": "Acme Corporates India",
  "gstin": "27ABCDE1234F1Z5",
  "email": "contact@acme.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "billingAddress": {
    "line1": "Acme Tower, Suite 404",
    "city": "Mumbai",
    "state": "Maharashtra",
    "pincode": "400001",
    "country": "India"
  },
  "creditLimit": 100000,
  "creditPeriodDays": 45,
  "openingBalance": 12500.00,
  "openingBalanceType": "Dr"
}


### 2. Create a New Customer (Invalid GSTIN Format)
# Returns 400 Bad Request if the GSTIN is provided but does not match Indian standard regex format.
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "name": "Bad GSTIN Corp",
  "gstin": "ABCDE1234FXXX",
  "billingAddress": {
    "line1": "Tech Park Lane",
    "city": "Bengaluru",
    "state": "Karnataka",
    "pincode": "560001"
  }
}


### 3. List Customers (Active, Search & Pagination)
# Lists active customers for the company.
# Query parameters: companyId (required), search (matches name, gstin, phone), page, limit.
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}&search=Acme&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 4. Get Single Customer Details
# Returns the detailed view of a customer including the computed outstanding currentBalance.
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 5. Update Customer details
# Reject changes to coaAccountId. If GSTIN is modified, validate format and duplicate constraints.
# Name and active state changes sync to the linked COA account.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Acme Corporates India Ltd.",
  "creditLimit": 150000,
  "email": "billing@acme.com"
}


### 6. Get Customer Ledger History
# Returns transaction outstanding balance details (delegates to placeholder logic for now).
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}/ledger?from=2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-08-31T23:59:59.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 7. Get Customer Invoices List
# Returns invoice details list (placeholder returning empty array for now).
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 8. Deactivate Customer (Soft Delete)
# Soft deletes (sets isActive: false) on the customer and the linked COA account to maintain historical reporting references.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
